# Holding mode ("coming soon"), with ONE exception: the instant quote tool stays
# public so Pete can price jobs on it and customers can self-serve a rough quote.
#
# Cloudflare Pages serves clean URLs (/foo.html 308-redirects to /foo). A
# *redirect* catch-all (302 -> /holding) fights that clean-URL redirect and
# loops. So the catch-all instead SERVES the holding page with a 200 rewrite.
# A 200 rewrite is internal (no redirect issued), so it cannot loop.

# The quote tool and everything it needs to run
/quote                           /quote.html                      200
/quote.html                      /quote.html                      200
/assets/*                        /assets/:splat                   200
/data/*                          /data/:splat                     200
/manifest.json                   /manifest.json                   200
/quote-tool-service-worker.js    /quote-tool-service-worker.js    200

# Everything else: serve the holding page in place (no redirect, no loop)
/*                               /holding.html                    200
